# TechExpo 2027 — Environment Configuration
# Default: Runs out-of-the-box on browser localStorage (Zero-config, no database required)

# OPTIONAL: Vercel KV / Upstash Redis Cloud Database (100% FREE on Vercel)
# 1. On Vercel: Dashboard > Storage > Create Database > KV (Upstash Redis)
# 2. Add these environment variables in Vercel project settings:
VITE_KV_REST_API_URL=https://your-database-id.upstash.io
VITE_KV_REST_API_TOKEN=your-upstash-rest-token-here

# Alternatively, Upstash Redis keys:
# VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://...
# VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...
